// The Loams Live sync API (design §20 §7, D121).
//
// A server stream (`Watch`) plus unary calls, never bidi: browsers cannot
// stream full duplex over fetch, and connect-rust sends no response on
// HTTP/1.1 until the request body ends. So one design works on HTTP/1.1 and
// HTTP/2, over Connect, gRPC and gRPC-Web.
//
// The server binds loopback only (D111) until LV1 moves Live to the main
// port (Task 12); the listener sits behind the engine's authentication
